          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nedumunye Daudi nelo, te nebo iltung'ana lenyena, near metuata Ilfilisti iip are; neyau Daudi isuaaten enye, naaishooki apa te siana nalulung'a olaiguanani, pee etum ninye ataa olaputani lo laiguanani. Neisho Saul ninye ina tito enye Mikal meitaa enkitok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ake pee edol Saul neyiolou ajo etii Olaitoriani te nebo Daudi, o nchere kenyor Isiraeli pooki ninye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "neponari Saul aureyu Daudi oleng. Neaku etaa apa Saul olmang'atinta le Daudi anaake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
